                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There are ways of knowing ourselves that thought alone cannot reach. Sometimes we need a mirror. Sometimes we need to be witnessed becoming the thing we already feel ourselves becoming."
